y attack is marked on the board before it lands: step out of the red and it misses. In the demo Play the Horse Master, who builds Momentum by moving and spends it in bursts The full first act: battles, elites, encounters, shops and rest stops A random act boss from three of the Nine Stars: Tianchong, the Broken Halberd; Tianqin, King of Birds; or Tianxin, the False Healer-I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691385","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4981020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:33Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4981020":"2026-10-26T05:54:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4981020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5009450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4981020","app_id":4981020,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:14Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"6b858fba7f18bdb7f10b970332a2e5307da9b712513827b08d26b41f7d261b77","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"모든 카드가 샹치(중국 장기)의 한 수가 되는 로그라이크 덱빌더. 마(馬)는 뛰어넘고, 포(砲)는 받침 너머를 꿰뚫고, 졸(卒)은 강을 건너면 되돌아서지 않는다. 적의 칼날이 어느 칸에 떨어질지 미리 보인다. 그 칸을 벗어나면 칼날은 허공만 가른다. 탁록의 싸움은 아직 끝나지 않았다. 이 끝내기는 삼천 년 동안 당신의 한 수를 기다려 왔다. 팔문을 깨고 구성(九星)과 마주하라. 일수불퇴.","publishers":[{"name":"AgentGameLab"}],"developers":[{"name":"AgentGameLab"}]},"relea